flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Create TCP socket]
    B --> C[Bind and listen on port 14055]
    C --> D[Wait with select()]
    D --> E{Ready descriptor?}
    E -->|Listener| F[accept client]
    F --> G[Initialize client state]
    G --> D
    E -->|Client| H[recv input]
    H --> I{Session state}
    I -->|Username| J[Store username; ask password]
    J --> D
    I -->|Password| K[Log login event; show prompt]
    K --> D
    I -->|Logged in| L[Log command]
    L --> M{Command = exit?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Send Bye; close client]
    M -->|No| O[Reply unknown command]
    N --> D
    O --> D
